      "balloons": [
        {
          "panel": "N9-01",
          "text": "Eleventh round complete.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-01",
          "text": "Good luck, Aren.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-03",
          "text": "I am Neris. I assess controlled transfers and supervise today\u2019s upper couriers.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-04",
          "text": "No fee. One bell of your time. A pass qualifies you for supervised light-transfer work.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-04",
          "text": "ArenI have one bell.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-05",
          "text": "Stay inside the blue mark. Wait for his invitation before the handover.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-06",
          "text": "A light wooden practice weight. No customer mail.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-06",
          "text": "NerisIf your footing, line or landing is wrong, do not launch. Call a reset.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-09",
          "text": "I kept thinking I would have to make it look easy.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-10",
          "text": "I need someone I can keep working beside. Show me that.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-17",
          "text": "One moment.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-19",
          "text": "Here. I can take it now.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-22",
          "text": "You stopped inside the mark. Then you left him time to finish.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-23",
          "text": "Was that enough?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-23",
          "text": "NerisFor the work we tested. You passed.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-24",
          "text": "Controlled transfer. Supervised light work. It is entered.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-25",
          "text": "I can authorize one carry with me now. It is optional.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-26",
          "text": "West sorting desk, by the corridor with me. One letter, another quarter bell.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-26",
          "text": "NerisThree coppers for this carry, paid at West desk.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-27",
          "text": "I have the quarter bell. I will take that one.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-30",
          "text": "Aren is cleared for this assignment, under my supervision. West desk.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-33",
          "text": "I have looked at these windows from below.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-33",
          "text": "NerisThey leak from this side too.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-34",
          "text": "The intake letter? Here, please.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-36",
          "text": "West desk. Received.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-36",
          "text": "NerisThat is the whole carry.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-37",
          "text": "Three coppers, as agreed.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-38",
          "text": "I want to remember this.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-38",
          "text": "SeraThen take a moment.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-39",
          "text": "I have two more desks. You are finished for today.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-40",
          "text": "I would like another assignment.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-40",
          "text": "NerisBring your available hours next time. We will see what needs doing.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-41",
          "text": "I still have time before supper.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N9-41",
          "text": "SeraShall we walk?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
